        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gas power plant, 100MWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gas power plant, 100MWe
Average gas power plant 100 MWe.;
UUID: 817e1ce5-814f-3226-8682-3d1c2967f59a
The module includes the most important materials used for construction. It includes also the energy requirements for construction; transport is implicitly included in energy consumption. (Life time for operation assumed 180"000 h.)
Location: Average conditions for European plants.
Technology: Average installed gas power plant
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_817e1ce5-814f-3226-8682-3d1c2967f59a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
